_meanings:
.²1 Enumeration, computation.
.²2 Sum, total, number: {#vittasya vidyAparisaMKyayA me#} <ls>R. 5. 21</ls>.
.²3 (In <ab>Mīm. phil.</ab>) Exclusion, specification, limitation to that which
 is enumerated or expressly mentioned, so that everything else is excluded;
 {#sAMKyadarSanametAvat parisaMKyAnudarSanam#} <ls>Mb. 12. 306. 42</ls>. [{#parisaMKyA#}
 is opposed to {#viDi#} which lays down a rule for the first time, and
 to {#niyama#} which restricts the choice to an alternative which is expressly
 stated when several such alternatives are possible]; {#viDiratyantamaprAptO#}
 {#niyamaH pAkzike sati . tatra cAnyatra ca prAptO parisaMKyeti gIyate ..#}
 {%<ab>e. g.</ab>%} {#paYca paccanaKA BakzyAH#} usually quoted by the Mīmāṃsakas;
 {#ayaM niyamaviDirna tu parisaMKyA#} <ls>Kull.</ls> on <ls>Ms. 3. 45</ls>. {#prAptasya punarvacanaM#}
 {#parisaMKyArTaM Bavati#} <ls>ŚB. on MS. 11. 1. 66</ls>. {#parisaMKyA#} also means
 a text laying down exclusion; <ab>cf.</ab> ({#viDiparisaMKyAsaMSaye viDirjyAyAn#}

 <ls>ŚB. on MS. 6. 4. 7</ls>); also {#parisaMKyAyAM svArTahAniH, parArTakalpanA#},
 {#prAptabADaSca .#}
.²4 (In <ab>Rhet.</ab>) Special mention or exclusive specification, {%<ab>i. e.</ab>%} where
 with or without a query something is affirmed for the denial, expressed
 or understood, of something else similar to it; (this figure is particluarly
 striking when it is based on a {#Sleza#} or pun); {#yasmin mahIM SAsati#}
 {#citrakarmasu varRasaMkarAScApezu guRacCedaH#} <ab>&c.</ab> or {#yasya nUpurezu#}
 {#muKaratA vivAhezu karagrahaRaM turaNgezu kaSABiGAtaH#} <ab>&c.</ab> K; for other
 examples see <ls>S. D. 735</ls>.
.²5 Recapitulation.
